{
 "source": "erica.mp4",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.031,
   "end": 4.572,
   "text": "I was so proud of myself for asking a how question because I just applied."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.772,
   "end": 8.513,
   "text": "I took action on what I just learned in the moment, girl."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.893,
   "end": 9.253,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.633,
   "end": 25.237,
   "text": "So what would you say was the biggest lesson that turned you from discouraged"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.364,
   "end": 29.684,
   "text": "to this is what I do for a living."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.984,
   "end": 33.325,
   "text": "Because that's powerful."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.545,
   "end": 34.465,
   "text": "That's powerful."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.846,
   "end": 37.046,
   "text": "Okay, say the question again."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.066,
   "end": 38.066,
   "text": "Say it again."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.086,
   "end": 40.366,
   "text": "Let me simplify it."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.746,
   "end": 40.966,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.547,
   "end": 44.627,
   "text": "What was the best lesson you learned from all that rejection?"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.727,
   "end": 55.649,
   "text": "I think the best lesson that I learned was that when I overcome, other people can overcome."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.861,
   "end": 86.128,
   "text": "and this is what I mean right when I finally broke through my own barriers when I finally stopped telling myself that I was not worth it that I cannot do it that I was too afraid when I finally showed up other people got to overcome as well it was beautiful it was beautiful so I think that was the biggest lesson wow"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.576,
   "end": 93.277,
   "text": "When I overcome, others overcome too."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.318,
   "end": 96.898,
   "text": "It's contagious, isn't it?"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.318,
   "end": 99.039,
   "text": "It's contagious."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.079,
   "end": 102.12,
   "text": "Give me goosebumps."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.18,
   "end": 108.062,
   "text": "Oh my goodness."
  },
  {
   "start": 109.823,
   "end": 117.425,
   "text": "It's so crazy how the Bible, it has said the same thing for thousands of years."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.435,
   "end": 120.58,
   "text": "And I've read it so many different times."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.342,
   "end": 124.931,
   "text": "In the same passage, I'll read it at different times in my life."
  },
  {
   "start": 126.214,
   "end": 126.315,
   "text": "And"
  }
 ],
